  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "A unit with Curse of the **Wulfen** gets its **OC** bonus only while free of [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) and within either of two ranges. The supporting model must be friendly. A **WOLF PRIEST** counts at up to 12″. A **SPACE WOLVES CHARACTER** that lacks **WULFEN** counts at up to 6″. Give **INFANTRY** models in the unit +1 **OC** and **VEHICLE** models +3 **OC**. Each **WULFEN** model occupies two places when counting **transport capacity**.",
